{"unit_id":"tag:06FG:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们的首个任务是证明，与“平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（finitely presented）的群胚（groupoid）”关联的商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0001>是代数栈（algebraic stack）。\n商叠（quotient stack）的定义见\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》\n定义<REF_0001>。\n以下引理是一个预备结果，对应于\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》\n引理<REF_0002>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"群胚源靶態射的平坦性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示","context":"群胚源靶态射局部有限表示；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"代数空间中的群胚；待批准。"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"群胚关联的商叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈","context":"商叠代数性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"章节名称核心；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"章节引用；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06FH:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为包含在<MATH_0002>中的概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的群胚（groupoid）。\n假设<MATH_0005>平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。\n则态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>平坦（flat）、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）\n且满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"底概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"群胚所在的范畴；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"代数空间中的群胚；待批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"源靶态射及商叠图册的平坦性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"源靶态射及商叠图册的有限性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"商叠图册的态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"图册满射性；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06FH:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），设<MATH_0002>\n为<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism）。须证明投影（projection）\n<MATH_0004>\n满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。\n已知左端可由代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0005>表示（representable），参见\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0001>和\n<REF_0002>。\n因此须证明对应的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，它是代数空间（algebraic spaces）之间的态射，满射（surjective）、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）且平坦（flat）。\n由于我们所讨论的是代数空间（algebraic spaces）态射（morphisms）的性质，且这些性质在fppf拓扑（topology）中为靶局部（local on the target）的，\n可在<MATH_0007>上fppf局部地（fppf locally）检验。由构造，存在\nfppf覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0008>，它覆盖<MATH_0009>，使得\n<MATH_0010>来自态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0011>。（注意，<MATH_0012>表示\n<MATH_0013>-纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0014>，\n故所有构造均与沿<MATH_0015>的基变换（base change）相容。）\n因此，可假设<MATH_0016>来自<MATH_0017>。\n在此情形下，有\n<MATH_0018>\n第一个等式由《范畴（Categories）》引理<REF_0003>得到，\n第二个等式由\n《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》\n引理<REF_0004>得到。\n显然，最后一个<MATH_0019>-纤维积（fibre product）由代数空间（algebraic space）\n<MATH_0020>表示，且投影（projection）\n<MATH_0021>平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），\n因为它是平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（finitely presented）的代数空间（algebraic spaces）\n态射（morphism）<MATH_0022>的基变换（base change）。\n它也满射（surjective），因为<MATH_0023>有截面（section）（即群胚（groupoid）的恒等（identity）\n<MATH_0024>）。\n引理得证。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local on the target","target_term":"靶局部"},{"source_term":"fppf locally","target_term":"fppf局部地"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"检验性质的底概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"叠或代数空间的态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"纤维积到一个因子的投影；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"图册与投影满射性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"图册与投影平坦性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"图册及投影的有限性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"表示纤维积；待批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示","context":"纤维积的可表性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"章节引用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射的源靶；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"靶局部性质所涉及的态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"fppf拓扑；待批准。"},{"source_term":"local on the target","target_term":"靶局部","context":"态射性质在靶上的局部性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"fppf locally","target_term":"fppf局部地","context":"在fppf覆盖上检验性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖","context":"使商叠对象来自图册的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积","context":"叠的2-纤维积；待批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"源态射与投影的基变换；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"章节引用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"章节名称核心；待批准。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示","context":"源态射局部有限表示；待批准。"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"群胚源映射的恒等截面；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"代数空间中的群胚；待批准。"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等","context":"群胚恒等映射；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
