{"unit_id":"tag:06FI:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为包含在<MATH_0002>中的概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的群胚（groupoid）。\n假设<MATH_0005>平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。\n则商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>上的代数栈（algebraic stack）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"底概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"群胚所在范畴；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"代数空间中的群胚；待批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"源靶态射的平坦性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"源靶态射有限性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"群胚关联的商叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈","context":"商叠的代数性；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06FI:proof","translation":"对态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0001>，\n检验定理<REF_0001>的两个条件。\n第一个条件显然成立（因为<MATH_0002>是代数空间（algebraic space））。\n第二个条件就是\n引理<REF_0002>的结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"商叠图册的态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"图册的表示对象；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06PI:title","translation":"何时商叠（quotient stack）是代数的（algebraic）？","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"本节的商叠代数性问题；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的","context":"叠具有代数性；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06PI:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》第<REF_0001>节，\n已定义商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0001>，它与代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的群胚（groupoid）\n<MATH_0002>关联。注意，<MATH_0003>是取值于群胚（groupoids）的叠（stack），\n其对角态射（diagonal）可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable）（参见\n《逐步构造》引理<REF_0002>\n及\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0003>），\n并且存在代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0004>与<MATH_0005>-态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0006>，后者是“fppf满射（surjection）”，\n意思是它在对象（objects）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的预层（presheaves）上诱导映射（map），\n该映射在层化（sheafification）后成为满射（surjective）。\n但是，一般而言，<MATH_0007>并不是代数栈（algebraic stack）。\n这不与定理<REF_0004>\n矛盾，因为<MATH_0008>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>未必\n平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n构造非代数（non-algebraic）商叠（quotient stacks）的例子，最容易的方法是\n考察形如<MATH_0010>的商（quotients），其中<MATH_0011>是概形（scheme），<MATH_0012>\n是<MATH_0013>上的群概形（group scheme），它在<MATH_0014>上平凡地作用（acting trivially）。具体说来，下面将说明\n（引理<REF_0005>），\n若<MATH_0015>是代数的（algebraic），则<MATH_0016>必须平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。\n明确的例子可见\n《例子》第<REF_0006>节。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"non-algebraic","target_term":"非代数"},{"source_term":"quotient stacks","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"quotients","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"acting trivially","target_term":"平凡地作用"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"章节名称核心；待批准。"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"群胚关联的商叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"群胚所在范畴；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"代数空间中的群胚；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"商叠的取值；待批准。"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"商叠的叠性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射","context":"商叠的对角态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示","context":"对角态射由代数空间表示；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"章节引用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"商叠图册的代数空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"商叠的图册态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射","context":"fppf意义的满射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"商叠的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"对象同构类的预层；待批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"对象同构类的预层；待批准。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"图册在对象同构类预层上诱导的映射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"对象同构类预层层化；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"层化后映射满射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈","context":"商叠的代数性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"图册或群结构态射平坦性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示","context":"图册或群结构态射有限性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"non-algebraic","target_term":"非代数","context":"不具有代数性的商叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"quotient stacks","target_term":"商叠","context":"非代数的商叠例子；待批准。"},{"source_term":"quotients","target_term":"商","context":"群平凡作用的商；待批准。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"群作用的底概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形","context":"平凡作用的群概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"acting trivially","target_term":"平凡地作用","context":"群在底概形上的作用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic","target_term":"代数的","context":"群平凡作用商的代数性；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
